var mark = 75
if mark >= 50 {
    print("Pass")
}
else {
    print("Fail")
}

If-Else Conditions
------------------
If-else is used to make decisions in a program.
For example:
- If a student scores above 50, they pass.
- Otherwise, they fail.

Else-If
CODE:
var mark = 85
if mark >= 90 {
    print("Grade A")
} else if mark >= 75 {
    print("Grade B")
} else if mark >= 50 {
    print("Grade C")
} else {
    print("Fail")
}
